WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.170
- [Announcer] Middle Ground
is a social experiment

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.650
that brings humans with
opposing beliefs together.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.520
These discussions may contain viewpoints

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.410
that are the result of misinformation.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.890
Remember to seek out experts

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:11.700
and to be critical of your own biases

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.040
while forming an opinion.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.510
Please see the humanity
in each participant

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.873
and as always, we encourage empathy.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.960
- There's plenty of people out there

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.100
that can separate sex and love.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.640
But for me, when I have sex with someone,

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.040
I fall in love with them.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.340
And while I do have friends with benefits,

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.070
these people are chosen very
specifically because I know

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.810
that I will have to go
through heartbreak on my own

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.715
when I have sex with them.

00:00:37.715 --> 00:00:40.298
(gentle music)

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:50.860
