if you agree with the prompt.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:55.173
I can separate love and sex.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.720
- For me, I think that I can separate it,

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.700
but often times it
doesn't turn out that way.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.750
This is kind of the cliche,

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.960
